      "card_ids": ["C04"],
      "claim": "The closest high-transfer analogue IBOX ([125I]IBOX) showed 1.43% dose/brain at 2 min after IV injection in mice and was explicitly classified as good BBB penetration, directly supporting meaningful CNS access for the query's dimethylamino-heteroaryl-vinyl-benzoxazole scaffold.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
